entor-widget elementor-widget-divider\" data-id=\"fbb74ec\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"divider.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-divider\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-divider-separator\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-2e7a66ac\" data-id=\"2e7a66ac\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4f585fca de_scroll_animation_no elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"4f585fca\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeIn&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Frequently asked questions<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-386281c1 de_scroll_animation_no elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"386281c1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeIn&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Answers for travelers in Cabo<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7e5e38b8 de_scroll_animation_no elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-accordion\" data-id=\"7e5e38b8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeIn&quot;,&quot;_animation_delay&quot;:400}\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-accordion.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\" >\n        <div class=\"elementskit-accordion accoedion-primary\" id=\"accordion-6ad0d5e8594a3\">\n\n            \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card active\">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-0-7e5e38b8\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-2d7faaa6ad0d5e8594a3\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" role=\"button\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-2d7faaa6ad0d5e8594a3\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-2d7faaa6ad0d5e8594a3\">\n                            \n                            <span class=\"ekit-accordion-title\">How fast can a doctor or nurse get to my hotel?<\/span>\n\n                            \n                                <div class=\"ekit_accordion_icon_group\">\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_normal_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Normal Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-chevron-down\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_active_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Active Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-chevron-left\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n                                <\/div>\n\n                            \n                                                    <\/a>\n                    <\/div>\n\n                    <div id=\"Collapse-2d7faaa6ad0d5e8594a3\" class=\" show collapse\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-0-7e5e38b8\" data-parent=\"#accordion-6ad0d5e8594a3\">\n\n                        <div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\">\n                            <p>Most house calls and IV visits arrive within 30\u201345 minutes anywhere in Cabo San Lucas, M\u00e9dano, Pedregal, and the Marina. Visits to the Corridor and San Jos\u00e9 del Cabo are typically 45\u201375 minutes depending on traffic.<\/p>                        <\/div>\n\n                    <\/div>\n\n                <\/div><!-- .elementskit-card END -->\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card \">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-1-7e5e38b8\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-e1ad9996ad0d5e8594a3\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" role=\"button\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-e1ad9996ad0d5e8594a3\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-e1ad9996ad0d5e8594a3\">\n                            \n                            <span class=\"ekit-accordion-title\">Are your doctors and nurses really licensed?<\/span>\n\n                            \n                                <div class=\"ekit_accordion_icon_group\">\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_normal_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Normal Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-chevron-down\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_active_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Active Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-chevron-left\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n                                <\/div>\n\n                            \n                                                    <\/a>\n                    <\/div>\n\n                    <div id=\"Collapse-e1ad9996ad0d5e8594a3\" class=\" collapse\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-1-7e5e38b8\" data-parent=\"#accordion-6ad0d5e8594a3\">\n\n                        <div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\">\n                            <p>Yes. All of our physicians and registered nurses are licensed in Mexico under COFEPRIS, the federal health authority. Our medical team is fluent in English and ingredients used in our IV drips are medical-grade, COFEPRIS-authorized, pharmaceutical-grade, and sterile.<!-- CWCMARKER1780088149562 --><\/p>                        <\/div>\n\n                    <\/div>\n\n                <\/div><!-- .elementskit-card END -->\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card \">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-2-7e5e38b8\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-bfdbcce6ad0d5e8594a3\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" role=\"button\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-bfdbcce6ad0d5e8594a3\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-bfdbcce6ad0d5e8594a3\">\n                            \n                            <span class=\"ekit-accordion-title\">Do you accept travel insurance?<\/span>\n\n                            \n                                <div class=\"ekit_accordion_icon_group\">\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_normal_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Normal Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-chevron-down\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_active_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Active Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-chevron-left\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n                                <\/div>\n\n                            \n                                                    <\/a>\n                    <\/div>\n\n                    <div id=\"Collapse-bfdbcce6ad0d5e8594a3\" class=\" collapse\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-2-7e5e38b8\" data-parent=\"#accordion-6ad0d5e8594a3\">\n\n                        <div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\">\n                            <p>We don't bill travel insurance directly, but we issue a fully itemized invoice in English with all relevant codes that you can submit to Allianz, GeoBlue, IMG, Aetna International, Cigna Global, or most major travel-insurance providers for reimbursement.<\/p>                        <\/div>\n\n                    <\/div>\n\n                <\/div><!-- .elementskit-card END -->\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card \">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-3-7e5e38b8\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-efd028b6ad0d5e8594a3\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" role=\"button\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-efd028b6ad0d5e8594a3\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-efd028b6ad0d5e8594a3\">\n                            \n                            <span class=\"ekit-accordion-title\">How much does an IV drip cost?<\/span>\n\n                            \n                                <div class=\"ekit_accordion_icon_group\">\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_normal_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Normal Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-chevron-down\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_active_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Active Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-chevron-left\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n                                <\/div>\n\n                            \n                                                    <\/a>\n                    <\/div>\n\n                    <div id=\"Collapse-efd028b6ad0d5e8594a3\" class=\" collapse\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-3-7e5e38b8\" data-parent=\"#accordion-6ad0d5e8594a3\">\n\n                        <div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\">\n                            <p>Our IV menu starts at $149 USD for a Hydration drip and goes up to $199 USD for our Recovery &amp; Rejuvenation drip. NAD+ is $189. Doctor house calls start at $200 USD, and walk-in clinic visits at our Downtown location start at $80 USD.<\/p>                        <\/div>\n\n                    <\/div>\n\n                <\/div><!-- .elementskit-card END -->\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card \">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-4-7e5e38b8\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-faq46ad0d5e8594a3\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" role=\"button\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-faq46ad0d5e8594a3\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-faq46ad0d5e8594a3\">\n                            \n                            <span class=\"ekit-accordion-title\">Do you offer a group or travel-party discount?<\/span>\n\n                            \n                                <div class=\"ekit_accordion_icon_group\">\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_normal_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Normal Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-chevron-down\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_active_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Active Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-chevron-left\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n                                <\/div>\n\n                            \n                                                    <\/a>\n                    <\/div>\n\n                    <div id=\"Collapse-faq46ad0d5e8594a3\" class=\" collapse\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-4-7e5e38b8\" data-parent=\"#accordion-6ad0d5e8594a3\">\n\n                        <div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\">\n                            <p>Yes. If you book 3 or more IV sessions at once (for example, a bachelorette weekend, a corporate retreat, or a fishing trip) we apply an automatic group discount. Ask our medical concierge for the current rate when you call.<\/p>                        <\/div>\n\n                    <\/div>\n\n                <\/div><!-- .elementskit-card END -->\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card \">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-5-7e5e38b8\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-faq56ad0d5e8594a3\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" role=\"button\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-faq56ad0d5e8594a3\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-faq56ad0d5e8594a3\">\n                            \n                            <span class=\"ekit-accordion-title\">What if I&#039;m in a private villa or on a yacht?<\/span>\n\n                            \n                                <div class=\"ekit_accordion_icon_group\">\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_normal_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Normal Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-chevron-down\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_active_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Active Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-chevron-left\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n                                <\/div>\n\n                            \n                                                    <\/a>\n                    <\/div>\n\n                    <div id=\"Collapse-faq56ad0d5e8594a3\" class=\" collapse\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-5-7e5e38b8\" data-parent=\"#accordion-6ad0d5e8594a3\">\n\n                        <div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\">\n                            <p>We cover private villas, gated communities (Pedregal, Querencia, Palmilla), and yachts in the Cabo San Lucas Marina. Just make sure security or the captain is expecting us so we can be cleared through.<\/p>                        <\/div>\n\n                    <\/div>\n\n                <\/div><!-- .elementskit-card END -->\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card \">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-6-7e5e38b8\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-faq66ad0d5e8594a3\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" role=\"button\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-faq66ad0d5e8594a3\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-faq66ad0d5e8594a3\">\n                            \n                            <span class=\"ekit-accordion-title\">Do I need an appointment?<\/span>\n\n                            \n                                <div class=\"ekit_accordion_icon_group\">\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_normal_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Normal Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-chevron-down\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_active_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Active Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-chevron-left\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n                                <\/div>\n\n                            \n                                                    <\/a>\n                    <\/div>\n\n                    <div id=\"Collapse-faq66ad0d5e8594a3\" class=\" collapse\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-6-7e5e38b8\" data-parent=\"#accordion-6ad0d5e8594a3\">\n\n                        <div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\">\n                            <p>For walk-in care at our Downtown Cabo San Lucas clinic, no \u2014 we are open 9 AM to 10 PM daily and welcome walk-ins. For house calls and IV therapy, just call or WhatsApp and we'll schedule the next available window, usually the same hour.<\/p>                        <\/div>\n\n                    <\/div>\n\n                <\/div><!-- .elementskit-card END -->\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card \">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-7-7e5e38b8\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-faq76ad0d5e8594a3\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" role=\"button\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-faq76ad0d5e8594a3\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-faq76ad0d5e8594a3\">\n                            \n                            <span class=\"ekit-accordion-title\">What forms of payment do you accept?<\/span>\n\n                            \n                                <div class=\"ekit_accordion_icon_group\">\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_normal_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Normal Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-chevron-down\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_active_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Active Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-chevron-left\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n                                <\/div>\n\n                            \n                                                    <\/a>\n                    <\/div>\n\n                    <div id=\"Collaps